  TextFields:
  - Andromeda vs Perseus
  - "I feel like Andromeda\u2014caught in chains, waiting for the monster.\nBeing
    Andromeda sucks\u2014the damsel in distress, stuck until someone else decides
    to rescue her.\nSomehow I\u2019m always far from the people I love.\nDad says
    we\u2019re constellations\u2014connected, even though the stars are light-years
    apart.\nAm I really part of that constellation, or just a lonely star?"
